# Frontend State Recorder — environment variables
#
# There are none. This tool is a client-side widget: it captures clicks,
# field changes, fetch() calls, and errors entirely in the browser using
# in-memory state, and never calls out to a server or third-party service.
#
# This file exists to satisfy the "clone, configure, run" checklist and to
# make that fact explicit rather than leaving newcomers to wonder whether
# they're missing a setup step.
#
# If you later wire the "Copy to Jira" / "Copy to GitHub Issue" buttons up
# to real APIs (instead of copy-to-clipboard), add the relevant keys here,
# e.g.:
# JIRA_API_TOKEN=
# GITHUB_TOKEN=
